{"id":4700,"date":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","date_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/?page_id=4700"},"modified":"2022-07-28T19:57:27","modified_gmt":"2022-07-28T19:57:27","slug":"music-overview","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/music-overview\/","title":{"rendered":"Music Overview"},"content":{"rendered":"<h3>When It&#8217;s Time to Play, We Go To Work!<\/h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-4701 \" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/music1.jpg\" alt=\"music1\" width=\"382\" height=\"164\" \/>JAMMIN\u2019 DJs has over 30,000 songs in our Music Library. Our selections include latest releases, Dance, Pop, Rock, Techno, Alternative, Fund, R&amp;B, Retro, Oldies, Country, Motown, Big Band, Swing, Jazz, Group participation, Polkas, dinner music\u2026 You name it, we\u2019ve got it.<\/p>\n<p>Once you reserve the date we email you a log in and password to our Music Request Site, and from there you can add songs to your \u201cMust Play\u201d, \u201cPlay If Possible\u201d &amp; \u201cDo Not Play Lists&#8230; \u00a0You can even listen to clips of the songs through your iTunes, and see the lyrics! \u00a0If you are stuck, our trained staff is more than happy to provide you with a list of songs that are most commonly requested!<\/p>\n<p>New! \u00a0Not only will you be able to have fun choosing your music selections, but now we offer a \u201cGuest Request List (With a log-in and password of their own) where guests can go online and select up to 4 songs each. \u00a0Our system will then rank the songs by popularity and give us a detailed list on the crowd\u2019s taste. \u00a0\u00a0You will be able to email or print the link on any website, invitation, or event announcement!<\/p>\n<p>If you\u2019re looking for a perfect mix of music at the appropriate volume for your next event, please be sure to<a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.djintelligenc